<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
    .content { background: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
    .footer { text-align: center; color: #666; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .details { background: white; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-left: 4px solid #4CAF50; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Schedule Confirmed</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{customerName}},</p>
      <p>Your healthcare appointment has been successfully scheduled.</p>
      
      <div class="details">
        <h3>Appointment Details:</h3>
        <p><strong>Objective:</strong> {{objective}}</p>
        <p><strong>Doctor:</strong> {{doctorName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Date & Time:</strong> {{scheduledAt}}</p>
      </div>

      <p>Please arrive 10 minutes before your scheduled time.</p>
      <p>If you need to reschedule or cancel, please contact us as soon as possible.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>This is an automated message from Healthcare Scheduling System.</p>
      <p>Please do not reply to this email.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
